 maximalism则象征春天旺盛的生命力与偶尔的骤雨。即兴结构呼应春天的不可预测性与自由生长。\",\n    \"technical_specs\": \"120 BPM | 键位: D大调（明亮温暖）| 结构: 自由即兴（Intro→Pad铺底→主旋律即兴→Bass加入→人声即兴→Chaotic Breakdown→渐出结尾）| 音色: Moog Sub37锯齿波主旋律, Prophet-6铺底Pad, 失真808 Bass,  pitched-up Vocal chops, 金属质感FX | 混音: 宽立体声场, 高频明亮处理, 多层级叠加但保持分离度\",\n    \"prompts\": [\"A vibrant hyperpop spring day with glittering synth arpeggios that mimic sunlight filtering through blossoms, a warm Moog bassline pulses like budding life, pitched-up vocal snippets laugh like a breezy meadow, chaotic metallic chimes scatter like rain showers, all evolving freely through lush Prophet pads that swell like a zen garden in full bloom - crystal clear fidelity with maximalist joy\"],\n    \"negative\": \"dark, melancholic, minimalist, low fidelity, muddy mix, repetitive loops, aggressive drums, industrial sounds, slow tempo, dissonant harmonies, traditional instruments\"\n}", "Title: 春衫薄\n\n【主歌A1】\n柳线穿风绣烟波\n苔痕新染旧石阶\n纸鸢牵着云朵走\n跌进粼光三寸河\n\n【主歌A2】\n桃瓣吻过青瓦檐\n新茶浮沉小瓷瓯\n谁家燕尾裁薄雾\n衔来半阙浣溪沙\n\n【桥段B】\n忽见陌头杨柳色\n方知流光抛人久\n借问春汛何处去\n一川烟雨答沉默\n\n【主歌A3】\n竹影漫叩碧纱窗\n杏花沾衣不肯落\n踏碎阶前月光白\n拾得春风词笔瘦", 1059745509800667, "fixed", 124, 120, "4", "zh", "D major", true, 2, 0.85, 0.9, 0, 0], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 261, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "tags"}, "name": "tags", "label": "tags", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 257, "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "bpm"}, "name": "bpm", "label": "bpm", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "bpm"}, {"widget": {"name": "duration"}, "name": "duration", "link": 251, "label": "duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "timesignature"}, "name": "timesignature", "label": "timesignature", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "timesignatur